					Why Google Lighthouse?
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8">
					It's Google's own scoring system — the most objective way to
					measure SEO quality, Core Web Vitals, accessibility, and
					performance. LaravelSeo integrates it directly into your
					project so you can iterate faster and deploy with
					confidence.
				</p>


			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Comparison Section -->
		<section class="section bg-white/10">
			<div class="container-custom">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16">
					Generic SEO vs. LaravelSeo
				</h2>
				<p class="text-center text-gray-400 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
					Most SEO tools are built for everyone, which means they
					aren't optimized for anyone. LaravelSeo is built exclusively
					for the Laravel ecosystem.
				</p>

				<div class="overflow-x-auto">
					<table class="w-full border-collapse">
						<thead>
							<tr class="bg-white/10">
								<th
									class="border border-white/10 p-4 text-left font-semibold"
									>Feature</th
								>
